%% IoT-Guard: main scenario, from traffic to alert
sequenceDiagram
    participant D as IoT device
    participant C as Traffic Collector
    participant F as Feature Extractor
    participant M as Detector
    participant S as Alert Store
    participant U as Dashboard user

    D->>C: packets (via mirror port)
    C->>F: packet batch (every 1 s)
    F->>M: feature vector (115 values)
    M->>M: predict(normal / attack)
    alt attack
        M->>S: save alert (device, time, score)
        S-->>U: new alert shown on dashboard
        U->>S: mark as true alert / false alarm
    else normal
        M-->>F: nothing to report
    end
